# 🔥 4. PROBLEM 3 — CONTAINS DUPLICATE

```text
[1,2,3,1]
```

Does any value appear more than once?

### Pattern:

# 👉 HASH SET

```python
def containsDuplicate(nums):
    seen = set()

    for x in nums:
        if x in seen:
            return True

        seen.add(x)

    return False
```

Complexity:

```text
Time  → O(n)
Space → O(n)
```

### 🧠 Recognition clue:

```text
Need fast existence checking
        ↓
Hash Set
```

